{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "bookCode": "RV10",
  "bookSlug": "rig-veda-book-10",
  "n": 154,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "refId": "RV10-154:1",
      "text": "translated by"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "refId": "RV10-154:2",
      "text": "1. FOR some is Soma purified, some sit by sacrificial oil:",
      "original": "सोम एकेभ्यः पवते घृतमेक उपासते ।",
      "translit": "soma ekebhyaḥ pavate ghṛtameka upāsate |"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "refId": "RV10-154:3",
      "text": "To those for whom the meath flows forth, even to those let him depart.",
      "original": "येभ्यो मधु प्रधावति ताँश्चिदेवापि गच्छतात्",
      "translit": "yebhyo madhu pradhāvati tām̐ścidevāpi gacchatāt"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "refId": "RV10-154:4",
      "text": "2. Invincible through Fervour, those whom Fervour hath advanced to heaven,",
      "original": "तपसा ये अनाधृष्यास्तपसा ये स्वर्ययुः ।",
      "translit": "tapasā ye anādhṛṣyāstapasā ye svaryayuḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "refId": "RV10-154:5",
      "text": "Who showed great Fervour in their lives, even to those let him depart.",
      "original": "तपो ये चक्रिरे महस्ताँश्चिदेवापि गच्छतात्",
      "translit": "tapo ye cakrire mahastām̐ścidevāpi gacchatāt"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "refId": "RV10-154:6",
      "text": "3. The heroes who contend in war and boldly cast their lives away,",
      "original": "ये युध्यन्ते प्रधनेषु शूरासो ये तनूत्यजः ।",
      "translit": "ye yudhyante pradhaneṣu śūrāso ye tanūtyajaḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "refId": "RV10-154:7",
      "text": "Or who give guerdon thousandfold, even to those let him depart.",
      "original": "ये वा सहस्रदक्षिणास्ताँश्चिदेवापि गच्छतात्",
      "translit": "ye vā sahasradakṣiṇāstām̐ścidevāpi gacchatāt"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "refId": "RV10-154:8",
      "text": "4. Yea, the first followers of Law, Law's pure and holy strengtheners,",
      "original": "ये चित्पूर्व ऋतसाप ऋतावान ऋतावृधः ।",
      "translit": "ye citpūrva ṛtasāpa ṛtāvāna ṛtāvṛdhaḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "refId": "RV10-154:9",
      "text": "The Fathers, Yama! Fervour-moved, even to those let him depart.",
      "original": "पितॄन्तपस्वतो यम ताँश्चिदेवापि गच्छतात्",
      "translit": "pitṝntapasvato yama tām̐ścidevāpi gacchatāt"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "refId": "RV10-154:10",
      "text": "5. Skilled in a thousand ways and means, the sages who protect the Sun,",
      "original": "सहस्रणीथाः कवयो ये गोपायन्ति सूर्यम् ।",
      "translit": "sahasraṇīthāḥ kavayo ye gopāyanti sūryam |"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "refId": "RV10-154:11",
      "text": "The Rsis, Yama! Fervour-moved, even to those let him depart.",
      "original": "ऋषीन्तपस्वतो यम तपोजाँ अपि गच्छतात्",
      "translit": "ṛṣīntapasvato yama tapojām̐ api gacchatāt"
    }
  ]
}
